{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "情绪网的定义", "content": "情绪网是指当孩子情绪抓狂、像下跌时，下面有一张网托住他，使他不会下跌到无法阻止的地步。从心理学上讲，这叫做情绪抵抗力。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪网", "情绪抵抗力"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00002"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "情绪网的定义与情绪抵抗力的定义一致", "reason": "情绪网是比喻，情绪抵抗力是心理学名词，两者描述同一现象", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a002", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0001", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "当需要了解情绪抵抗力的术语定义时", "reason": "Source 使用情绪抵抗力但未定义，candidate 给出情绪网定义即为情绪抵抗力，属术语补充但关联不强。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-c-17", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "平时为孩子的情绪做预防建设时", "reason": "候选与旧原子情绪网定义等价，均描述为托住下跌情绪的网，称为情绪抵抗力。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-r-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：理解情绪网/情绪抵抗力；区别：候选定义情绪网，旧原子用其比喻但未定义。", "reason": "补充情绪网的定义。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "情绪抵抗力的定义", "content": "情绪抵抗力是指当人一直往下叠（情绪低落）时，有很多因素可以编织成一张网，把他托在那儿，让他叠不下去。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪抵抗力", "情绪网"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a001", "kind": "defines", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a004", "kind": "causes", "condition": "情绪抵抗力好的人能成功", "reason": "情绪抵抗力好的人能在负面经历中反弹并成功", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a001", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0001", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-r-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：理解情绪抵抗力；区别：候选解释何种因素编织成网托住情绪，旧原子未展开。", "reason": "补充情绪抵抗力的具体内涵。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "负面经历的定义", "content": "负面经历是指如被冤枉偷钱、替别人背锅、被误会、殃及池鱼成为受害者等经历。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["负面经历"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "relation", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "情绪抵抗力的作用", "content": "情绪抵抗力好的孩子能在负面经历中反弹起来，甚至从经历中挖出宝贵经验，伴随一生，帮助以后继续成功。情绪抵抗力好的人，不管在多么艰难的境遇中都能成功；情绪抵抗力不好的人，再好的条件也会失败。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪抵抗力", "成功"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a005", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "富翁绝地重生案例", "reason": "富翁绝地重生是情绪抵抗力好的例证", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "当讨论情绪抵抗力的具体作用时", "reason": "Source 提到有助于情绪抵抗力，candidate 阐述情绪抵抗力好的人能反弹并成功，但未直接关联吃苦过程。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-r-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：情绪抵抗力的作用；区别：候选说明抵抗力好的人能从负面经历中反弹并挖掘经验，旧原子只说负面经历不把情绪拖垮。", "reason": "补充情绪抵抗力的长期效果。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "综艺节目中的富翁绝地重生案例", "content": "有一部综艺节目，把百万富翁、千万富翁、亿万富翁的钱全部拿走，让他们在没钱的情况下进入穷人的境地，看他们能否在多久之内创造出价值。结果这些人往往最后都能够绝地重生，原因正是他们的情绪抵抗力。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪抵抗力", "案例"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a004", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "情绪网的五个方面", "content": "情绪网分为五个方面：自身、社交、家庭、情商和成长。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪网", "分类"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a001", "kind": "applies_to", "condition": "情绪网分为五个方面", "reason": "情绪网包含五个方面", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-c-17", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "平时为孩子的情绪做预防建设时", "reason": "候选直接列出情绪网的五个方面，与旧原子完全一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "精力与情绪的关系", "content": "精力充沛对情绪有好处：当一个人累的时候，特别容易感到情绪低落，容易发脾气。孩子累了、精力不好、疲倦时就会烦躁。所以精力好可以帮助一个人延缓情绪烦躁的几率。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["精力", "情绪"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00008", "b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a008", "kind": "supports", "condition": "精力差与消极心态相关", "reason": "精力差导致消极心态，精力好延缓情绪烦躁", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:r001", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0006", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "relation", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "精力差与消极心态的关系", "content": "越是负面消极的人，精力越差，比如逛街一会儿就累，整天需要睡觉，做什么事情做一下就累。这种人往往比较消极、负面，容易进入受害者心态。而精力充沛、活力满满的人很少被负面经历死死网住，他们也会有负面经历和情绪，但情绪不至于把他们卡死，他们相对更有精力去处理负面经历。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["精力", "消极心态"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00009", "b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a007", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "提升孩子精力的方法：高强度运动", "content": "提升孩子精力的方法是让孩子动起来，进行大量的高强度运动，如打篮球（正儿八经地跟很多人一起抢篮球）、踢足球等。", "steps": ["让孩子参与高强度运动，如打篮球、踢足球", "确保运动中有竞争和坚持，不能随意退出"], "conditions": [], "limits": ["低强度活动如游乐场、骑自行车、滑滑轮、爬山等不足以提升精力，需要高强度运动"], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["精力", "运动"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a007", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "提升孩子精力的高强度运动方法与精力充沛对情绪有益的观点相关，但后者不涉及运动方法，前者未直接论述情绪好处，缺乏直接支持关系。", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "两端均涉及精力，但一个是提升方法，一个是情绪后果，仅议题相关。"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a007", "kind": "supports", "condition": "高强度运动提升精力", "reason": "高强度运动通过提升精力，进而支持精力好可以延缓情绪烦躁的观点。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "因果链合理，但按允许类型以 supports 表示。"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:r002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "高强度运动提升精力的机制", "reason": "高强度运动需要咬牙坚持的机制支持高强度运动作为提升孩子精力的方法。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "直接支持。"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:r002", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0008", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "当需要具体提升精力的运动方法时", "reason": "Source 未说明吃苦的具体形式，candidate 补充高强度运动如篮球、足球，并要求竞争和坚持，并指出低强度活动不足。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "讲师童年高强度运动训练案例", "content": "讲师小时候是超级学渣，但体育特别好，进入学校校队练田径。老师训练很残忍：一个人在前面跑，另一个人在后面追，如果后面的人追到前面的人，前面的人就做俯卧撑；如果没追到，后面的人就被罚。所以前面的人发狂跑，后面的人发疯追。每天这样高强度训练，讲师吃饭吃得好，从不挑食。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["高强度运动", "童年经历"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": ["训练方式可能涉及体罚，需核验其适当性"], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a009", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "讲师童年高强度运动训练案例是提升孩子精力的高强度运动方法的例证。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "案例到概念方向正确。"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a009", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "讲师童年高强度运动训练案例", "reason": "讲师童年高强度运动训练案例具体体现了提升孩子精力的高强度运动方法。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "类似。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "relation", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "高强度运动训练对成年后耐力的影响", "content": "孩子当时高强度运动训练看起来很惨，但久了以后，特别是长大后，他能够负荷很累的事情。讲师在疫情期间，和先生全职工作，两个孩子24小时在家18个月，没有给孩子看电视和手机，讲师白天工作，晚上对接中国工作，相当于做两份全职工作，同时写家庭焦虑情绪手册，全时间带孩子，每天只睡四五个小时。很多时候累到极点，但总能撑过最累的点，这种感觉很熟悉，就是以前跑步训练时那种过不去但必须过去的感觉。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["耐力", "运动训练"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016", "b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a010", "kind": "causes", "condition": "高强度运动训练可能提升成年后的耐力", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a009", "kind": "supports", "condition": "高强度运动训练对成年后耐力的影响", "reason": "高强度运动训练对成年后耐力的积极影响支持高强度运动作为提升孩子精力的有效方法。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原因果方向不成立，改为支持。"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "当需要说明高强度运动如何影响成年后耐力时", "reason": "Source 称吃大苦有助于情绪抵抗力，candidate 以讲师自身经历为例，具体说明高强度运动训练后能负荷劳累，增强耐力。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "自我照顾的定义", "content": "自我照顾是指孩子学会照顾自己，这是父母教的。很多人把自我照顾和自私混淆，认为照顾自己不顾别人就是自私。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["自我照顾", "自私"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a017", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "自我照顾与自私的区别", "reason": "自我照顾与自私不同，有三个区别", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "训练孩子自我照顾的方法一：每天留出时间关注自己", "content": "每天特别给孩子留出时间，让他自我照顾。例如孩子放学回家后，留出一段时间，问他在学校怎么样、心情还好吗，同时给他按摩或揉脚。养成习惯，让他知道每天都有时间留出来看看自己感觉好不好。", "steps": ["孩子放学回家后，留出专门时间", "询问学校情况和心情", "同时进行身体接触，如按摩、揉脚", "每天坚持，形成习惯"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["自我照顾", "习惯养成"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a012", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a012", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "训练孩子自我照顾的方法一", "reason": "每天留出时间关注自己是自我照顾的训练方法", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "训练孩子自我照顾的方法二：让孩子享受所做的事", "content": "让孩子享受他去做的事情。不是所有事情孩子都能享受，但应该有一些事情是他自己会享受的。父母要学会给孩子留时间，按照他想玩的去玩。", "steps": ["观察孩子享受的事情", "给孩子留出时间做他想做的事"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["自我照顾", "享受"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00019", "b00020"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a012", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a012", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "训练孩子自我照顾的方法二", "reason": "让孩子享受所做的事是自我照顾的训练方法", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "孩子享受时间不应作为交换条件", "content": "父母不可以把留给孩子去玩自己真正想玩的东西作为一个交换条件，来强迫他吃饭或放学先做作业。孩子每天都应该有这样的时间，就像每天都要吃饭一样，不应该今天考得好就给饭吃，考得不好就不给饭吃。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["交换条件", "界限"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00020", "b00021"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a014", "kind": "exception", "condition": "享受时间不应作为奖惩条件", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a014", "kind": "applies_to", "condition": "孩子享受时间不应作为交换条件", "reason": "享受时间不应作为交换条件", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "游戏不是洪水猛兽", "content": "游戏不是洪水猛兽，孩子打游戏、发呆、做白日梦，只要是他喜欢做的，每天都要给他时间。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["游戏", "自我照顾"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00021"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a014", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a014", "kind": "supports", "condition": "游戏不是洪水猛兽", "reason": "游戏等喜欢做的事应每天给孩子时间", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "自私与自我照顾的三个区别", "content": "自私和自我照顾的最大区别有三个：第一，自私是通过各种手段方法，哪怕是操控、欺骗别人，不惜以伤害别人为代价来获得自己想要的利益；而自我照顾是用自己所有的资源和能力照顾自己，不存在操纵别人。第二，自私会伤害两个人的关系，而自我照顾会让你和别人的关系更加亲近，因为自我照顾后，休息和喘息得到满足，能更好地爱别人。第三，自私是要别人去做你想要的事情，而自我照顾是自己去做自己需要的事情。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["自私", "自我照顾", "区别"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023", "b00024"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a012", "kind": "defines", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a019", "kind": "supports", "condition": "自我照顾优先原则", "reason": "自我照顾优先于帮助他人", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:r003", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0017", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "legacy:jx-c-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：区分自私与自我照顾；共同适用：涉及是否损害他人或操纵他人。", "reason": "候选提供三个区别标准（是否操纵/伤害他人、是否破坏关系、要求别人做 vs 自己做），为旧原子补充更可操作的判断依据。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-c-02", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：需要区分自我照顾与自私的场景；区别：旧原子概括核心区别，候选补充自私表现（操控欺骗）、对关系影响等额外细节。", "reason": "候选扩展了三方面区别，涵盖旧原子并增加新内容。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "自我照顾优先于帮助他人的案例", "content": "一个好朋友打电话给你，他情绪非常低落，可能今天会伤害自己，叫你过去陪他。但恰巧这几天你自己的情绪也非常低落，也有想伤害自己的念头，如果再听到负面东西，情绪可能承受不住。在这种情况下，你应该拒绝过去陪伴他，因为你需要先保护、照顾好自己的情绪健康。一旦进入他的情绪，你很可能自己会被勾起来，不但不能保护他，还会伤害自己。这个拒绝看起来像自私，但实际是自我照顾优先。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["自我照顾", "案例"], "evidence": "hypothetical", "risk_flags": ["涉及自我伤害念头，需专业支持"], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00024", "b00025"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a017", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a019", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "自我照顾优先于帮助他人的案例", "reason": "案例说明自我照顾优先原则", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "自我照顾优先原则", "content": "一定是自我照顾优先，然后才是照顾别人，因为爱人如己，自己不爱自己，没有办法好好爱别人。先照顾自己，然后再去帮助别人。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["自我照顾", "优先原则"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a019", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00026"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a017", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0019"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "有意义的亲密关系的定义", "content": "有意义的亲密关系不是孩子小的时候跟别人玩三分钟就说“你是我最好的朋友”那种玩伴关系，而是在长期关系中有矛盾、会不在一起玩，但接下来又在一起玩，是孩子自己真正选择、真正喜欢的。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["亲密关系", "社交"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00026", "b00027"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a021", "kind": "supports", "condition": "有意义的亲密关系与稳定安全的朋友圈", "reason": "稳定安全的朋友圈是有意义的亲密关系的基础", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "稳定安全的朋友圈的定义", "content": "稳定安全的朋友圈是指孩子有一个稳定的、安全的朋友圈。安全是指这些孩子不会把你的孩子往坏的方面带；稳定是指成员是大家都熟悉的，比如看着长大的，或者父母之间彼此知根知底的。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["朋友圈", "社交"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a021", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00027", "b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a020", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0021"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "学员群体稳定朋友圈案例", "content": "有一群学员，他们没有进到不抓狂的打卡班课群，自己有一个群体。这个群体的孩子是大家一起看着长大的，父母彼此认识熟知。讲师被其中两位妈妈极力推荐进入这个群。孩子们从小一起长大，妈妈们每一堂课都一起报名学习，除了打卡还有自己的学习班，每个星期聚在一起分享上课的想法和感受。父母一起成长，孩子也一起长大，经过很多事情，这群孩子始终在一起长大。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["朋友圈", "案例"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a022", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00028", "b00029", "b00030"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a021", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a021", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "学员群体稳定朋友圈案例", "reason": "学员群体是稳定安全朋友圈的例证", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0022"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "孩子需要可信任的长辈", "content": "孩子除了父母以外，需要有可信任、可倾诉、遇到困难会去寻求帮助的长辈，大概在父母年龄层的人，比如父母的朋友，从小看着孩子长大，孩子会越过父母去找那个长辈谈。这个长辈一定要是安全的人，最好同性，没有性侵等问题。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["信任长辈", "社交"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["涉及性侵风险，需谨慎选择"], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a023", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00030", "b00031"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a021", "kind": "applies_to", "condition": "孩子需要可信任的长辈", "reason": "可信任的长辈是稳定安全朋友圈的一部分", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0023"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "孩子需要要好的异性朋友", "content": "孩子需要有很要好的异性朋友。当孩子十三四岁时，如果他想跟喜欢的人早恋，这是非常好的，因为这是亲密关系的初试，是他第一次经历跟异性的亲密关系。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["异性朋友", "早恋"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a024", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00032"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a020", "kind": "applies_to", "condition": "孩子需要要好的异性朋友", "reason": "异性朋友是有意义的亲密关系的一种", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:r004", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0024", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0024"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "父母处理早恋的方法", "content": "父母在早恋问题上要有智慧地处理：孩子们可以在哪里约会？不能单独约会，要在公共场合。早恋本身是非常好的事情。", "steps": ["规定约会地点：公共场合", "不允许单独约会"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["早恋", "界限"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a025", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00033"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a024", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a024", "kind": "applies_to", "condition": "父母处理早恋的方法", "reason": "父母处理早恋的方法适用于异性朋友关系", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0025"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "anti-pattern", "subtype": "counterexample", "title": "禁止早恋的反例", "content": "很多家长不让孩子早恋，大学也不许谈恋爱，好好考大学，考完大学好好读书，读到大四出来赶紧结婚。这样孩子没有任何容错范围，从来没有练习过怎么谈恋爱，突然要谈一个恋爱然后进入婚姻，要不然就太晚了，父母就催婚。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["早恋", "反例"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a026", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00033", "b00034"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a024", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a025", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "禁止早恋的反例", "reason": "禁止早恋与有智慧地处理早恋相反", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0026"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "早恋的益处", "content": "父母要让孩子在安全的时候，也就是年纪轻、管得住、还在监控范围的时候，帮助孩子谈恋爱。万一遇到渣男也不怕，容错几率大。让孩子有这些经验，以后谈婚论嫁时已经有过亲密关系经历，知道什么是他喜欢的、不喜欢的、合适的、不合适的。父母应允许并鼓励孩子正常健康地与异性谈恋爱。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["早恋", "益处"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a027", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9497c35b483f", "blocks": ["b00034", "b00035"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a024", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "早恋的益处包括容错、经验积累等，支持孩子需要有要好的异性朋友并尝试早恋的观点。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "直接支持。"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:a024", "kind": "supports", "condition": "早恋的益处", "reason": "早恋益处中的容错机制和经验积累支持孩子有异性朋友和早恋的重要性。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "同。"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:r005", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0027", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:r006", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0027", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9497c35b483f-c001:u0027"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
